---

## Getting Started

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd TEHQIQAAT
```

### Backend

```bash
cd backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

### Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Configure the required API keys and environment variables using `.env.example`.

---

## Documentation

Detailed documentation covering the **system architecture, agent workflow, modules, decision logic, AI models, risk assessment, and implementation details** is available in the [`docs/`](./docs) directory.

---

## Disclaimer

TEHQIQAAT is a **hackathon prototype and decision-support system**. It is not intended to autonomously determine whether a person or document is legally admissible or fraudulent. Final decisions remain with authorized personnel.

